{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1564,
  "batch_count": 1682,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "f1c6893d60a8989361cfd9c371f56bc8ec25f81d",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:baef7147d37e47f3beb17757",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "时代乃是乱世，群雄割据——\r\n然而夺得胜利的，\r\n乃是这碧玉队队长神业是也！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e5472392b3866857b966f9a03a65b9e77434566444f355db3f7600e941ee120",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af0e03ace0c56dcebd81bc05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闭上眼，就会浮现出大量的\r\n画面……呵呵，\r\n今天该展现怎样的跑法呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89697846f25419d4919bc5c1cd4479b9dde0c547593cb766b29c930aeeeb33b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feb66fcdd2df40554c0c558a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "回头请让我听听感想哦。\r\n毕竟，这是由我和你\r\n共同创作出的故事啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5846b3077927aea9c41a56608aefba239b6c185a0772f3d0d00bd898672c9707",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3b18acb2e2c11902060d001",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "绝对不能起步晚了……\r\n注意……注意……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f9f209c5b9989dd1e82cfeae30530e0ce27bf93cc1138e517b414375f21df96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1712a0839e33a7319af3aef1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再这样下去读者会流失的……！\r\n得趁现在想个好主意\r\n推上一把才行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31f1d4398e407efed223ec2fa1aad7564dd4e080eaf5f7fb43b103c79a5ce309",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd03bb267d6b22d434952122",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果是『魔刃战记雷牙』的主人公的话，\r\n这种时候一定会向剑祈祷……\r\n那我就，向这双腿祈愿——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cfe3940f4270f2b0055a67163eb1e5d97865f3655475652e8d0c3cf8239f943",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6842d37c9bb0721809e42116",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家看起来都很顺利呢……\r\n……可恶，我绝对不能\r\n从画框里掉队，绝对！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40552a9df0778977a05e95f50af1e5135305994be3c39d3a3cba581605880594",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1ec330fc3fb5f0625997122",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……唔，我不会放弃的……\r\n绝不会让给任何人……\r\n那个位置，是属于我的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b2e691136b4685ce657c56ecc88b11d385b1aa118d6a354abbe514f0c1a71be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86a33d5d235ad8a21bae09b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比起世界的广阔，\r\n我的力量不过是微不足道的……\r\n但——即便如此……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "39eb2c89a2bca38b0c36f3e78cc6ab4557cb4754645ca36faaea3803ae342d5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81eb1c6f4af9327d1744b274",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……唔，\r\n这种时候才要转换思路……\r\n我一定会，将其转化为转机的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d06b85a62c637ae2e37e4015ee593b881d7d840514ac86eeb77abe997fb18e68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:113a17be8ce955890af578db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么！",
      "source_fingerprint": "658bbd8cd44f72bb2183c9129d871d7974593067bf46b39a4b4b6f717fa7b205",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:045134ed5e324b369ecf6c1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好——勒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "abfefbba28a55dbf8d68c45b6956a3f29394ad31bcf23eeda77a043855b7b22b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8debfebda23c923e4abc9960",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f6f9cb6d386b03a59eafb944e976a93775f81d43c59dffa89b8cc34793a942f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6dbd6cc1ccf96f1dcdd27d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8aff8d6a40236a89cdb01f630cd8575cd2f08bf9ab729c81d73e621086d8659e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21e22bcd3513407fd7588c04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "10be977f31df1e46adc09787dbdd00b70a6dc9bf88d757d3b56385ddc573ffd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d50863390bb98fa31811c28f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdba625e48012ccb9ad71877721cc10414ee827e304b5a1a6b72f395d5735f23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21484068449b604648665a96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "778f2d205d4eaf97bc7ba75792626a5d8a4695e1fb0cb5ca44b7b560dd525d9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:390d69e265b2df4d32aaa2ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "享受其中吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c2f654c5e24c2099cb8e8020d04931f54e37216909c06ee573eb06f2f7f3103",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf1f1c7fbcbe16bf61b5ff5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是一个精彩的故事！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9988d5094868aee1238bec136fb38cce0e5e954539ee3b75837867bf700a3023",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:626886ad6719cb4b307b288e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "非常感谢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89543484a8bb0d4eccf8aa729c9eaace993bac645d1655911a89474a71aefb9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:035508a685986afc9c172d5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "燃烧灵魂吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6846dad93f42057268ccf63695969cbbf6fa646e5ee71bd5310467eb45a72e0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1019ce61f25037130c6ace2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "齐心协力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd907fc0e3075c088b53272466bd1e995f66aa3c353b82ddb2f25fe46c133e2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4a28181a69b1c0046021b0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "非常感谢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89543484a8bb0d4eccf8aa729c9eaace993bac645d1655911a89474a71aefb9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6e65d4c5e692f5528d2114b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "时代乃是乱世，群雄割据——\r\n然而夺得胜利的，\r\n乃是这碧玉队队长神业是也！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e5472392b3866857b966f9a03a65b9e77434566444f355db3f7600e941ee120",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08170c9b70a2c80058135def",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这胸中的悸动……颤抖……！\r\n我要全部、全部发挥出来，去创造——\r\n足以留在心底的名留青史之战！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "febaed5fb0ad706a06b0a17ba18b9c5ce58d95bc63ac170d4eee6cbe8b635ba5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f98125174890f893c837481",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "非常感谢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89543484a8bb0d4eccf8aa729c9eaace993bac645d1655911a89474a71aefb9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e5f9eb2acd88b2acca02b1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好——勒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "abfefbba28a55dbf8d68c45b6956a3f29394ad31bcf23eeda77a043855b7b22b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03571adb8501c448fa085e58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好可惜……！要是再多挣扎一下的话……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c73c15a0a76815689ced033370af9e740b0bb7587c43429abd65ddf7369500ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e456d041ede443992529acc7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勉强合格吧……！现实果然很残酷啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b499e4893463fbf8e05c578d3d4633bd3a17b4d037e8c2431e293b31351f5e01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3322fb6aaa8e86986c8e928d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的韧性可是超乎想象的……！下次一定会赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2fd0972be5dc2cdab4416d216dffd7f0d9d96057be40a618f34726c1b40979d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f58247edc0ef7d04603c01ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样子……实在太……微不足道了……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ddf49258f6cf1941a39c8731908dc088892eb506d7e8a11d0adb579ce81085d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8556c915c1fe8d006642cba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个故事的主人公——就是我！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7ac52b342f995747fc7c0149ffc34b5736516b1936395cf57b599097d23c308",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d8ac98ad6217bad64c698e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样！你的内心，有没有跟着燃起来！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4499b45f2e7a5760f0eabef343de0c890370dadabee0cdab16b84cd8a624d4c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f1edd76800d36a4493cde5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开幕了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "66c0e7a305e5a1aa2005a29839cb0cf9a7ce89b94bcd2148d0e46a1cc963801b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d22022015825d45481066fc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是属于我的故事！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b832d2fd256d00cbe1c3dc5e3411baac18e1f89fef9bd553f713210d342f02be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11849d9856412a6c06f70094",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "借着要参加比赛的理由，忍不住\r\n狂买了一通……钓鱼漫画！\r\n明明买回来未读的书，还有好多好多啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0da82fbea138e2bc4920cc349112ad3c4788976b049e6cf9cb3d25d8511473b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb82f6ffd0eab5a3377db3b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "令人念念不忘的『气泡茶』……\r\n除了那台自动售货机之外，\r\n到底要在哪里才能买到啊——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a48b43dd4fadbe4a9be9ab33f45f8c2233ca43fa492ff6994cbe4f3d44db0ae3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c726f247a7a460ee0f4cfc4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名留青史之战将由我，由我……由我来创造！\r\n赌上性命——燃尽灵魂吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c5e0da73b2a408b74502dfc0d9940ccf1c4f15d1267e33e954735138b59560c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66664a42e9042255dc6411e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本来想着把合宿里的经历画成\r\n纪实漫画的，但还是算啦！\r\n哼哼……总感觉，并不是那样的夏天呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "54ecc24687a94a493ae0dcacf1845a74d6b8f921d8b001f09e73cd0d756ff8e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8417e7d230b2b5689831d70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算这喉咙燃至干涸，我也要继续唱下去！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd390dc61747325db7288b5bad1a551d14547532fa3de497f531c24153a642ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:797c1b76d1807a45a9d3e581",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也要用最精彩的方式带动演唱会的气氛～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "249a2e6b6234d12e0523fcc5a2891b6cc02036d29470efdd17331c859c940610",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6572814dfeed148e4d1f3fad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会成为主人公的……绝对！",
      "source_fingerprint": "975c2fd0a943b934060874a707c8767b60599042282a7ed715788e4415f1624a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b42649e759849fa36cd4a5f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这真是突如其来且平凡、\r\n却又令我心潮澎湃的邂逅。……因为，\r\n是你带给了我这份雀跃感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00bc6bc18f488e033225f65d7fea51e3f3095f25ce07cf09342bc75e4042a6cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5831aeea613352ba4fc3a17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服是校园题材的必需品呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "333aa125571fd2ed29635e953374d948c9221dc79f87ac6fc7031a11784ac13f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a90cc22573eea51c392283e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现场的欢呼果然很让人开心呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea732a7d9c1a499cd9923f57817d4f95d7f4cccbbed8c6d21cef083909f5c4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b10fe593a57e423aa3d4d160",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是兼顾了奔跑便利性和绘画便利性的设计！",
      "source_fingerprint": "377594c01f834b790a4c83bf2d3f91f02a01044aa6fc1ce01000965769328b19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d23810df7a40ebd99a317564",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "洒掉墨水的时候真是惨不忍睹啊……啊哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dda9f48806c560aead916db8ae2526bd622e17f68c2d85c176915febdb1ed33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
