        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed3eb157be736197fafa5fcb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶像的奋斗也和战斗很相似呢～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf265c822d8f9126911123645ce520ca20ec753f7b76fdd9e626938ec17fd497",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c7b3b7c58987f26ae00f8e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要登顶……那无人能及的巅峰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c53a1d0c3fcf140a2601810222e2cc52fc6892110cdfee897a5ee7339f5f281",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce587ea1db69c7642132df3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变身！……感觉怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "aba5ac1a07ea5b849f37e1d58dcad5d0d7ccda4e882b6c2964f85580f2207f00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a755ab8b074996ae15ab0fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "原来如此，这种设计也可以有啊……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "378dbef913a4caaf176f4f17ba5680c68e057ddb53160b1763425f7d23f209bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96c3dead06404a6819766faf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毕竟还是要优先考虑\r\n作业的便利性呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfae171d58c0f184c8ed754c286176498aff119aeed3970bb2ed4c7f544438dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d552caf5dff2db7eea1a7703",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帽子是私服里也必不可少的单品。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3b6f77a7a5762093f3b6e2c212db86d4b976b62db4b2498d7294a2de784a151",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4a37abf2a2e87f0ab887e12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服是校园题材的必需品呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "333aa125571fd2ed29635e953374d948c9221dc79f87ac6fc7031a11784ac13f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d7c5787bf495c94cc495dd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现场的欢呼果然很让人开心呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea732a7d9c1a499cd9923f57817d4f95d7f4cccbbed8c6d21cef083909f5c4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
